%% Figure 4-2 — Request to verified outcome.
%% Message: every hop is authorized and recorded; the model proposes, the
%% platform decides, and the effect is proven before the answer is returned.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Run as Run Service
    participant Agent as Agent Runtime
    participant Pol as Policy & Identity
    participant Tool as Tool Gateway
    participant Sys as System of Record

    User->>Run: request + delegated grant
    Run->>Run: open run, pin versions
    Run->>Agent: bounded step
    Agent->>Pol: resolve authorized context
    Pol-->>Agent: context manifest id
    Agent-->>Run: typed tool proposal
    Note over Run,Pol: the model proposes, the platform decides
    Run->>Pol: authorize action for this subject
    Pol-->>Run: grant, or refusal
    Run->>Tool: invoke with logical effect key
    Tool->>Sys: commit effect
    Sys-->>Tool: receipt
    Tool-->>Run: effect record
    Run->>Run: verify acceptance criteria
    Run-->>User: verified outcome + evidence
